s new positives.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The percentages for HIV testing events are column percentages.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The denominator for the percentage for newly identified HIV-positive persons is HIV testing events.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}